---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Where /api/confirm sends someone once their token checks out. The worker does the
// verifying, so this page only renders the outcome: the download, or the expired-link state
// it redirects to when a token is forged, altered or older than 30 days.
const GUIDE_PATH = '/guides/5-golden-quarter-google-ads-tactics-q4.pdf';
---

<Layout
  title="Your Q4 Playbook | Visible Ads"
  description="Your confirmed copy of the 5 Golden Quarter Google Ads Tactics playbook."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="bg-white px-4 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-8 items-start">
        <img
          src="/images/guides/q4-playbook-cover.png"
          alt="Cover of the 5 Golden Quarter Google Ads Tactics playbook"
          width="1191"
          height="1685"
          class="w-40 sm:w-48 rounded-lg shadow-xl ring-1 ring-navy/10"
        />

        <div>
          <div id="playbook-ready">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-success bg-success/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              Email confirmed
            </div>

            <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-navy leading-tight mb-4">
              Here is your playbook
            </h1>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
              Thanks for confirming. <strong>5 Golden Quarter Google Ads Tactics for Q4</strong>
              is ready. The link in your email keeps working, so you can come back to it.
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
              <a
                href={GUIDE_PATH}
                download
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-cta text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-electric transition-colors shadow-lg"
              >
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4v12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4M4 20h16" /></svg>
                Download the playbook
              </a>
              <a
                href="/free-ads-audit"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-white text-navy font-semibold rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-electric hover:text-electric transition-colors"
              >
                Book a profit audit
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="playbook-expired" class="hidden">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber bg-amber/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              Link expired
            </div>

            <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-navy leading-tight mb-4">
              That link has expired
            </h1>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Confirmation links last 30 days, and this one is past that or has been altered
              somewhere along the way.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
              Email <a href="mailto:hello@visible-ads.com" class="text-electric underline">hello@visible-ads.com</a>
              and we will send a fresh copy straight over.
            </p>

            <a
              href="/contact"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-cta text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-electric transition-colors shadow-lg"
            >
              Ask for a new link
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">Read next</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">
          The playbook covers the structure. These two go deeper on running Q4 for profit
          rather than revenue.
        </p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/roas-vs-profit" class="block p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-electric hover:shadow-md transition-all">
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-1">ROAS vs profit</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">Why a 4x ROAS can still lose money, and the POAS calculator that shows it.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/break-even-roas" class="block p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-electric hover:shadow-md transition-all">
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-1">Break-even ROAS by margin</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">The number to cap Black Friday bidding against, worked out from your own margin.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
    if (window.location.pathname.replace(/\/+$/, '') !== '/playbook') return;
    const expired = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('status') === 'expired';
    document.getElementById('playbook-ready')?.classList.toggle('hidden', expired);
    document.getElementById('playbook-expired')?.classList.toggle('hidden', !expired);

    if (!expired && typeof (window as any).gtag === 'function') {
      (window as any).gtag('event', 'guide_email_confirmed', { guide: 'q4-playbook' });
    }
  });
</script>
